## Phase 3 — Command model and UX
- [x] `src/main.sh` dispatches subcommands; unknown subcommand → help + exit 2; `help` or empty → usage + exit 0.
- [x] Each subcommand has its own `parse_<cmd>_opts` and `run_<cmd>` following the portable `getopts` long-option mapping via `-:`.
- [x] Global flags honored by all subcommands: `--help`, `--quiet`, `--verbose`, `--no-color`, `--non-interactive`.
- [x] Add `--version` printing git tag/commit when available.

