## Phase 4 — Dockerfile hygiene (minimal but pinned)
- [x] Base: pin to a small image (e.g., `alpine:3.20`). Avoid `:latest`.
- [x] Install pinned OpenSSL (e.g., `apk add --no-cache openssl=~3.1 bash`).
- [x] Non-root user, executable scripts, and minimal entrypoint.

