- [ ] Run cert-manager export; inspect generated Secret/Issuer; optionally test in a sandbox cluster.
- [ ] Ensure destructive operations require explicit flags; re-running `init` warns unless `--force`.
- [ ] Ensure logs respect `--quiet`, `--verbose`, and `--no-color`.
- [ ] Tag a release and update `--version` output.

